{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And against all the congregation He will be wrath.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, will be wrathful if you mourn, for it will appear that the sacrifices you offered on behalf of the people were not accepted favorably. And if you ask: if so, why will your brothers mourn — does no one take pity on their death? Therefore it says: ״כל בית ישראל״ etc."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:55.104479877Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}